{"UUID":"65d5fe4b-d2eb-4542-9093-7a5155602448","DebugName":"EchhartSecurity_Nyx_Hard_RecoverCargo","Type":"ContractGeneratorHandler_Career","MissionType":{"UUID":"62f92440-202a-43d3-9cb8-b917d4e4a102","Name":"Mercenary"},"MissionGiver":"Eckhart Security","Title":"High Risk Shipment Recovery","TitleKey":"EckhartSecurity_RecoverCargo_Hard_Title","Description":"ECKHART SECURITY, LLC.\nCONTRACTS & DISPATCH\n\nCONTRACT TYPE: Recover Cargo\nApproval code: = ~mission(ApprovalCode)\n\nFOR IMMEDIATE PROCESSING\n\nGot a transport in need of backup over at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>. Signal was patchy, but their comms made it sound like a group of outlaws had gotten wind of what they were hauling and attempted to take it from them.\n\nConsidering the state of things before we lost contact, I'm considering this a recovery mission. Multiple hostiles are expected at the site, so a skilled crew is crucial for the success of this operation. There will be a high volume of cargo to deal with, so a ship that can carry <EM4>~mission(MissionMaxSCUSize) cargo containers</EM4> and a <EM4>heavy-duty tractor beam</EM4> will be needed. \n\nUpon successful extraction of cargo, deliver to the freight elevator at <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>.\n\nThis contract is non-negotiable.\n\nThis message may contain confidential, proprietary, privileged and/or private information. The information is intended to be for the use of the individual or entity designated above.","DescriptionKey":"EckhartSecurity_RecoverCargo_Hard_Description","DisplayDescription":"ECKHART SECURITY, LLC.\nCONTRACTS & DISPATCH\n\nCONTRACT TYPE: Recover Cargo\nApproval code: = [ApprovalCode]\n\nFOR IMMEDIATE PROCESSING\n\nGot a transport in need of backup over at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4>. Signal was patchy, but their comms made it sound like a group of outlaws had gotten wind of what they were hauling and attempted to take it from them.\n\nConsidering the state of things before we lost contact, I'm consi